  "prefLabel": "Ph 1806.05 Excess CEUs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1806.05 Excess CEUs. Excess CEUs earned in one licensure period shall not be carried forward into the new licensure period for the purpose of fulfilling that year’s continuing education prerequisite for licensure renewal.\n\nSource. #13463, eff 10-18-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
